 <content>\textbf{Definition 0.1}

A morphism $\Map fAB$ is a \emph{monomorphism}, if for any two morphisms $\Map{g,h}CA$ the equality $f\circ g=f\circ h$ implies $h=g$.
\end{definition}</content>
